.SS "\fBp4est_gloidx_t\fP p8est_partition_ext (\fBp8est_t\fP * p8est, int partition_for_coarsening, \fBp8est_weight_t\fP weight_fn)"

.PP
Repartition the forest\&. The forest is partitioned between processors such that each processor has an approximately equal number of quadrants (or weight)\&.
.PP
The user data of a \fBp8est_quadrant\fP is transferred along within this function\&.
.PP
The only extension of this function over \fBp8est_partition\fP is the return value\&.
