.br
\fIpartition_for_coarsening\fP If true, the partition is modified to allow one level of coarsening\&. 
.br
\fIweight_fn\fP A weighting function or NULL for uniform partitioning\&. A weighting function with constant weight 1 on each quadrant is equivalent to weight_fn == NULL but other constant weightings may result in different uniform partitionings\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The global number of shipped quadrants 
.RE
.PP

